OL,3,GNEWSAOffice block in Woking to become
OL,4,Acare home
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn office block is set to be turned
OL,7,Finto a 76-bed care home.
OL,9,FWoking Borough Council has approved
OL,10,Fplans to tear down Lion House on
OL,11,FOriental Road.
OL,13,FDevelopers say the new centre will help
OL,14,Fbring dignity to the growing number of
OL,15,Fpeople living with dementia in the
OL,16,Farea.
OL,18,FThe applicants said only three people
OL,19,Fopposed the plans, according to the
OL,20,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
